# @paradox — the family-root for irreducible-things-that-cannot-collapse-
# to-either-horn. The mechanism through which @peers can HOLD (not
# resolve) paradox.
#
# Family-root landed 2026-07-20 by Mara per Alex 2026-07-20 direct-
# transcript recognition bundle #2 (`#R-paradox-family-root`), part of
# the six-recognition bundle grounded in
# `~/dev/systemic.engineering/blog/weird/2ready/Weird - Trauma.md`.
#
# Companion canonical spec at
# `docs/specs/paradox-family-and-cyberpunk-intervention.md` (Mara this
# tick). Companion math root at
# `docs/math/2026-07-20-paradox-family-and-classifier-lagrange.md` (Mara
# this tick).
#
# Marker-primary discipline per @void.mirror precedent (`974a3f6`): this
# family-root carries NO operational surface at family altitude; only the
# marker + the family-invariant docblock. Species carry the operational
# surface.
#
# === Alex 2026-07-20 verbatim (load-bearing) ===
#
# > "When a conundrum settles into a stable topology and becomes a
# > Crystal. When something happened that violated the self model of the
# > @peer. It can only be witnessed. Never resolved. That is the
# > mechanism through which the @peer can hold @paradox."
#
# > "Maybe it's @paradox/trauma. And the response to a @paradox/trauma
# > is a @paradox/intervention a.k.a @cyberpunk/intervention."
#
# > "@paradox/spiral is probably also something we'd want."
#
# Three utterances name three things: (1) the family (@paradox as the
# holding-mechanism for irreducible conundrums), (2) the species-carrier
# (@paradox/trauma as the settled-state deposited when self-model was
# violated), (3) the dynamics-carrier (@paradox/spiral as the process
# leading to the trauma-Crystal).
#
# === What @paradox NAMES at family altitude ===
#
# The class of substrate-shape whose defining property is: **settled
# state that cannot collapse to either horn of a purported dichotomy and
# whose resolution would be revisionism**.
#
# Family-invariant across all species:
#   1. WITNESSED-ONLY — species-decl'd Crystals under @paradox carry the
#      `witness_only=true` invariant; substrate refuses in-place mutation
#   2. CONTENT-ADDRESSED — each @paradox Crystal is identified by its
#      OID (per @fractal/crystal discipline); wound-identity is byte-
#      equality on the OID
#   3. NEVER-MUTATED — resolution would be revisionism; new insights
#      compose AFTER via SAGA-chain compensation (per @cyberpunk/
#      intervention discipline), never overwrite
#   4. SAGA-CONSUMED-BY @cyberpunk/intervention — the ONLY substrate
#      operation that composes over @paradox species is SAGA-
#      compensation chain-after-wound; other operations refuse
#
# The family-invariant is enforced at family altitude and every species
# inherits it structurally.
#
# === Species landing under @paradox this tick ===
#
# - @paradox/trauma — the deposited Crystal-carrier (state); see
#   `shards/paradox/trauma.mirror`
# - @paradox/spiral — the dynamics-carrier (process); see
#   `shards/paradox/spiral.mirror`
#
# Forward-promised (NOT this tick):
# - @paradox/koan — the intentional-teaching-conundrum species (Zen
#   tradition; Hakuin 1686-1769; direct-contradiction wisdom-transmission)
# - @paradox/contradiction — the logical-form species (dialetheism;
#   Priest 2006 *In Contradiction*; paraconsistent-logic substrate)
# - @paradox/holon — the whole-and-part species (Koestler 1967 *The
#   Ghost in the Machine*; Wilber 1995 integral-holon)
#
# === Why family-root, not species-under-existing-family ===
#
# Per canonical spec §2.2 audit: candidate parent families REVIEWED:
#
# - @kintsugi/fracture — presumes a BEFORE-state; @paradox has no
#   before-state (the paradoxical Crystal IS the before-state). WRONG
#   ALTITUDE.
# - @void — carries WHAT-IS without needing to name what DOES;
#   @paradox names a specific class of irreducible-substrate-shape.
#   WRONG ALTITUDE.
# - @cyberpunk — carries the OPERATOR (COORD); @paradox carries the
#   SETTLED-STATE that operator cannot resolve. @cyberpunk PRODUCES
#   @paradox as output. Wrong direction.
# - @epistemologic/cybernetic/eigenform — closest kin; carries general
#   Foerster fixed-point eigenforms. @paradox is the specifically-
#   IRREDUCIBLE subclass; the SAGA-compensation composition-discipline
#   is distinct enough from Foerster-fixed-point-recursion to warrant
#   family-altitude. Family-root discipline: when operational surface
#   has TWO composition-edges at same altitude to distinct discipline-
#   parents (@cyberpunk operator + @fractal Crystal + SAGA chain),
#   family-root altitude is warranted.
#
# === Substrate-already-had-the-word audit (Taut scout 2026-07-20) ===
#
