# Per @void.mirror precedent (`974a3f6`): the family-root marker carries
# no operational surface. The operational surface lives at species
# altitude (@paradox/trauma, @paradox/spiral).
#
# The family-invariant is enforced STRUCTURALLY:
# - Every species-decl file at `shards/paradox/*.mirror` MUST declare
#   the witness_only invariant in its docblock
# - Every species-decl MUST NOT provide a mutation action that would
#   violate the invariant
# - Every species-decl MUST compose with @cyberpunk/intervention as the
#   ONLY consumer at substrate altitude
#
# Consumers verify family-membership via the `in @paradox` import at
# the top of the species-decl file. The import IS the family-
# membership witness.

